OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate sector interest in digital
OL,4,Agreenhouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centre for digital and creative
OL,7,Fstart-ups could be saved with the
OL,8,Fprivate sector interested in taking it
OL,9,Fon, the States of Guernsey has said.
OL,11,FEarlier this year the States announced
OL,12,Fthe Digital Greenhouse, which it opened
OL,13,Fin 2016, would close in its current
OL,14,Fform unless a private company or
OL,15,Fcharity came forward to run it.
OL,17,FThe Committee for Economic Development
OL,18,Fsaid it had been approached by people
OL,19,Finterested in taking the incubator into
OL,20,Fthe private sector with supporting
OL,21,Fgrants.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
