OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate sector interest in digital
OL,4,Agreenhouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Marc Laine, the committee's
OL,7,Fvice-president, said: "We want to
OL,8,Fturbo-charge the support that is in
OL,9,Fplace and drive real innovation and
OL,10,Fgrowth in our economy."
